             ELK CONFIGURATION FILES
=========================================================

=========================================================
ELASTICSEARCH
=========================================================

Configuration File

/etc/elasticsearch/elasticsearch.yml

Purpose

Main Elasticsearch Configuration

Important Parameters

cluster.name

Logical Cluster Name

Example

cluster.name: elk-cluster

----------------------------------------------------

node.name

Logical Node Name

Example

node.name: node1

----------------------------------------------------

network.host

127.0.0.1

Listen only localhost

0.0.0.0

Listen on every Interface

----------------------------------------------------

http.port

9200

REST API

----------------------------------------------------

transport.port

9300

Node Communication

----------------------------------------------------

discovery.type

single-node

Single Node Cluster

Multi Node

discovery.seed_hosts

cluster.initial_master_nodes

----------------------------------------------------

path.data

Stores Elasticsearch Data

Default

/var/lib/elasticsearch

----------------------------------------------------

path.logs

Stores Elasticsearch Logs

Default

/var/log/elasticsearch

